  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Directory App**\n\nI\'m focusing on user-friendliness and portability for a standalone directory application. The goal is a modern replacement for the clunky old Word-based system in a public administration setting, considering a German language requirement. I\'m exploring features that enhance search and navigation for easy contact look-up.\n\n\n**Refining App Requirements**\n\nI\'ve just finished a quick skill check and ruled out a lot of potentially irrelevant technologies. I\'m carefully reviewing the environment constraints, focusing on the core requirements of a standalone, user-friendly HTML application with local storage persistence and JSON export/import capabilities. Single-page app in React/Tailwind/Vite seems right.\n\n\n**Finalizing App Features**\n\nI\'m now nailing down the key app features. It needs robust local storage with German sample data. I\'m prioritizing single-file HTML export for offline access, JSON import/export for data portability, and intuitive contact fields. I\'ll include a live search and location-based filtering for user convenience. I want this app to be an elegant, practical, and a standalone solution!\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 779241913
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
