  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Storage Updates**\n\nI\'m currently focused on how to handle data storage updates. I\'ve noted the existing `STORAGE_KEY` and am thinking through strategies for managing version changes, like bumping the key or updating default contacts. The goal is to ensure a smooth transition and maintain data integrity, considering options like merging or replacing data when a new `STORAGE_KEY` is loaded, potentially checking for specific contacts, like those from Hanau, to determine the appropriate update strategy.\n\n\n**Verifying New Contacts**\n\nI\'m now meticulously verifying and formatting the Hanau contact entries. Each one from the provided Docx table image is being carefully transcribed, paying close attention to details like positions, departments, and especially phone numbers and email addresses. I\'m ensuring accuracy with the `06181 9452-` prefix and correct email domains. The goal is to prepare for immediate deployment, so users get accurate and properly formatted contacts instantly upon loading.\n\n\n**Analyzing New Contact Details**\n\nI\'m now carefully processing new contact details. I have meticulously captured details for five more individuals from the Hanau office. I ensured that I accurately transcribed all names, positions, departments, direct phone numbers, and mobile numbers. I\'ve also double-checked all email addresses to guarantee they are correctly formatted and that the domains are accurate, ready for immediate use.\n\n\n**Processing New Contacts**\n\nI\'ve just added five more detailed contact entries from Hanau to the list. I ensured each entry included the name, position, department, and both direct and mobile numbers. I\'ve meticulously checked the email addresses, confirming their formatting and domains are accurate. The data is ready to be implemented.\n\n\n**Adding More Contacts**\n\nI\'ve just added five more detailed contact entries from Hanau, meticulously including all the necessary details. I\'ve ensured each entry has accurate names, positions, departments, direct phone numbers, and mobile numbers. I\'ve double-checked all emails for correct formatting, including the systeex.de domain.\n\n\n**Incorporating More Contacts**\n\nI\'ve just added the latest five contact entries from the Hanau location. I\'ve recorded and double-checked names, roles, departments, direct phone numbers, and mobile numbers. The email addresses have been verified to include the correct systeex.de domain. The aim is still to get all the data ready for deployment as quickly as possible.\n\n\n**Adding More Contacts**\n\nI have just added two new contacts: Shirin Abalaaf (Azubi Industriekauffrau) and Tim Grauer (Teamleiter Lager), including all relevant information like phone numbers and departments, along with their respective email addresses, all of which I\'ve checked. I\'m now cross-referencing all these contacts with the provided image for complete accuracy.\n\n\n**Adding More Contacts**\n\nI\'ve just added the latest contacts from the provided data. I\'ve recorded and double-checked the names, positions, departments, direct phone numbers, and mobile numbers for each entry. All information is confirmed to be accurate. I\'m preparing all of the gathered data to be incorporated.\n\nI\'m checking the `src/lib/storage.ts` key now.\n\n\n**Implementing Data Migration**\n\nI\'m now focusing on a data migration strategy. I plan to update the `STORAGE_KEY` to `\'telefonverzeichnis_kontakte_v2\'` or modify `loadContactsFromStorage()` so that users automatically receive all 24 Hanau contacts when their current contacts don\'t include them, or if the storage key is updated. I\'ll prioritize updating `src/data/initialContacts.ts` with these new Hanau contacts as the primary content, and am preparing `STANDORTE_SUGGESTIONS` and `ABTEILUNGEN_SUGGESTIONS` now.\n\n\n"
