    thinking: "**Considering Data Migration**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the implications of a complete contact replacement within the application, based on the full PDF dataset. I\'m also delving into the architectural considerations and potential data models for a centralized master data management system, specifically the integration of \"Stamm-Daten\" (like locations). This is a crucial area to address.\n\n\n**Extracting Structured Data**\n\nI\'m now deep in the process of extracting contacts from the PDF, page by page. I\'m building a structured TypeScript data structure (`initialContacts.ts`) and meticulously populating it. Furthermore, I\'m thinking about developing a Master Data Manager modal, where users can add, edit, or delete locations and departments, or conveniently select from a list.\n\n\n**Analyzing Contact Data**\n\nI\'ve just added several contacts to the dataset, focusing on role and mobile information extraction. I\'m prioritizing the refinement of the extraction logic to handle various formats and ensure data integrity. I\'m also considering creating a test for the mobile number to validate these contacts better.\n\n\n**Expanding Contact Database**\n\nI\'ve just added several more contacts to the dataset, including their roles, phone numbers, and titles. I\'m prioritizing accuracy in mobile number extraction and verifying the extraction logic. I\'ll need to keep refining the format for consistency.\n\n\n**Adding More Contacts**\n\nI\'ve just added several more contacts, including titles and mobile numbers, focusing on accuracy in extraction and validation. I\'m prioritizing refinement for format consistency, working on the next few contacts. I\'ll need to keep refining the format for consistency to ensure smooth and accurate data transfer.\n\n\n**Adding More Contacts**\n\nI\'ve just added several more contacts, including titles and mobile numbers, focusing on accuracy in extraction and validation. I\'m prioritizing refinement for format consistency, working on the next few contacts. I\'ll need to keep refining the format for consistency to ensure smooth and accurate data transfer.\n\nI\'m now adding contacts, specifically focusing on roles, phone numbers, and titles. I\'m prioritizing precise mobile number extraction and improving the extraction logic to manage diverse formats and data integrity. I\'ll also explore testing mobile numbers to better validate these contacts.\n\n\n**Populating Contact List**\n\nI\'ve just added several more contacts with titles, roles and mobile numbers, including the next ones from the PDF. I\'m focused on keeping the mobile numbers accurate, and refining the data extraction logic. I\'m working on the data format consistency and will explore a mobile number format validation.\n\n\n**Adding More Contacts**\n\nI\'ve just added several more contacts, extracting their titles, roles and phone numbers from the data. I\'m focusing on ensuring accuracy in the extraction process, especially with mobile numbers, and I\'m refining the data for consistency. I\'ve noted the lack of mobile numbers for the last contact, and I\'m now working on the next entries in the PDF.\n\n\n**Adding More Contacts**\n\nI\'ve just added several more contacts, capturing their roles, phone numbers, and titles. Accuracy in mobile number extraction is still my key focus, alongside refining the data format for consistency. I have already noted the lack of mobile numbers for the last contacts, and I\'m currently adding the next few in the PDF.\n\n\n**Adding More Contacts**\n\nI\'ve just added several more contacts, extracting their roles, phone numbers, and titles. Accuracy in mobile number extraction is still my key focus, alongside refining the data format for consistency. I have already noted the lack of mobile numbers for the last contacts, and I\'m currently adding the next few in the PDF.\n\n\n**Extracting Contact Details**\n\nI\'ve just added several more contacts to the growing list, extracting their roles, phone numbers, and titles from the provided dataset. Accuracy in mobile number extraction is my primary focus, alongside meticulous data format refinement for consistency. I\'m now processing the next entries from the PDF.\n\n\n**Adding More Contacts**\n\nI\'ve just added several more contacts, focusing on extracting their roles, phone numbers, and titles. Precision in mobile number extraction remains paramount, along with refining the data format for consistency. I\'m now processing the next entries from the PDF. I\'m currently adding the next few in the PDF, and I have just added the mobile number of the last contact.\n\n\n**Continuing Contact Extraction**\n\nI\'ve just added several more contacts, capturing titles, roles and mobile numbers. My focus remains on pinpoint accuracy with mobile numbers and maintaining a clean, consistent data format. I\'m carefully going through the next entries in the PDF now.\n\n\n**Adding More Contacts**\n\nI\'ve just added several more contacts, extracting roles, phone numbers and titles from the data. I\'m prioritizing accuracy in mobile number extraction and refining the data format for consistency. I\'ve noted a lack of mobile numbers for the last contact. I\'m currently processing the next entries from the PDF. I have just added the mobile number of the last contact.\n\n\n"
