7 Julian, Kahabka Monique, K\303\266nitzer Gunter, Kr\303\266nke Claudia, and Krug Alexander. The current task is adding each entry and the associated details to the `INITIAL_CONTACTS`.\n\n\n**Adding Final Contacts**\n\nI\'m now integrating the most recent contacts into `INITIAL_CONTACTS`, including Lauber Stefan, L\303\244\303\237iger Mika, Sieg Peter, and others from Hanau. I am focusing on ensuring all available mobile numbers are accurately captured and organized. I\'m also adding Cornelius Steffen, Krabsch Moritz, L\303\266scher Marco, and Schrantz Sarah to the list. I am meticulously reviewing each entry.\n\n\n**Incorporating Further Details**\n\nI\'m now integrating new contacts from Elmenhorst and Erfurt. I\'ve added Schreck Romina, Schwamberger J\303\266rg (0152 54581046), Vetterlein Thomas (0162 2607653), and Wien Sven (0151 54461160) from Hanau. I\'ve also incorporated the details of Brillowski Nannette, Gentzen Tony, Harbrecht Alexander, Ru\303\237 Frank (0151 57130124), and Schmidt Benjamin from Elmenhorst. Finally, I\'ve added Halang Frank (0172 1359438), Rothe Heiko (0162 2134430), and Seif Jessica from Erfurt. My priority is accuracy in recording all relevant phone numbers.\n\n\n**Adding Freiburg Contacts**\n\nI\'m now integrating the new Freiburg contacts from Anlagenbau and Service, meticulously adding each detail to `INITIAL_CONTACTS`. I\'ve added Dahinten Daniel, Ernst Gerald, Hertweck Constanze, Iwertowski Stefan, Jung Raphael, Tritschler Sabine, and Zarnovicka Alena from Anlagenbau. I am now adding the Service contacts, including Abel Philipp, Leukel Tobias, L\303\274tje Udo, and Mutz Andreas. I\'m focusing on accuracy, verifying all the phone numbers, mobile and otherwise.\n\n\n**Adding New Contacts**\n\nI\'m now focusing on integrating new data. I\'ve logged Sahin Oktay, Tritschler Sabine, Berisa Mahmut, G\303\274rel Nadir, Kunzok Kristine, Krause Christian, K\303\274hn Karsten, Lemeshko Tetiana, Schurawin Wladimir, and Weidner Tabea, along with their associated phone numbers, titles and departments to `INITIAL_CONTACTS`. I\'m meticulously adding details from Hamburg, including Ask Maxim and others. My emphasis is on full inclusion.\n\n\n**Adding New Contacts**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the final entries for today. I am adding contacts from Hamburg and Hannover, from the remaining data. Specifically, I\'ve integrated Boeck Klaus (0151 42224241), Herzberg Danny (0151 54461190), and Loveimi Ghazaleh (0151 42224599). I\'m carefully recording Moritz Rayk (0172 1583591), and Safaie Arash. I\'m prioritizing accuracy for those new contacts, as well as Strehl Alexander, and Schneider Kim Bianka. I\'m ensuring details for Wichmann Christian (0172 1359127) are included. The final focus is on the Hannover contacts.\nI\'m also including Bargemann Olaf (0162 2613146), Beier Anna, and Decher Ren\303\251 (0172 4085549). Lastly, I\'m integrating Grote Sebastian, and Kahl Yann.\n\n\n**Adding Final Contacts**\n\nI\'m now integrating the final entries. From Hanau, I\'ve added Eck Patrick, Lutter Wilfried, Melek Seyda, Otte Andrea, Sarch Roman, Theiss Lutz, and Zamzow Leni. I have also added contact information from Heidelberg: Sayyad Camilo and Scholz Sarah. Additionally, I\'ve integrated Drabek Max, Kuckelkorn Nina, Otten Lennart, and Petrikowski Ursula, from K\303\266ln. I\'m prioritizing accuracy for these service contacts.\n\n\n**Adding Final Contacts**\n\nI\'m now integrating the most recent contacts: Posch Karl (0151 57130160), Rieger Christoph (0151 54461167), Br\303\274ck Sabine, Krahforst Eduard (0151 42224249), Mlakar Kristine, Struk Maike, Bartelt Anke (0175 9248076), Berger Daniela, Sohr Kevin (0151 42229143), Schr\303\266der Julia (0151 42229144). I\'m focusing on meticulous data verification, and ensuring that all details are accurately added to `INITIAL_CONTACTS`.\n\n\n**Finalizing Contact List**\n\nI\'m now integrating contacts from the Sauerlach and Forstinning locations. I\'ve added Cikan Sakir, Galba Jose