    thinking: "**Updating German Text**\n\nI\'ve homed in on the German text within `handleResetSampleData` in `App.tsx`. The confirmation message contained outdated language (\"8 Beispieldaten\"), which I\'m updating. This requires a precise translation for the user\'s confirmation message, which is now ready for revision.\n\n\n**Integrating Master Data**\n\nI\'m now integrating Master Data State into `App.tsx` using `useState` and `useEffect` for persistence, specifically managing `masterStandorte`, `masterAbteilungen`, and the `isMasterDataModalOpen` flag. I\'m also combining `masterStandorte` with all existing locations from contact data using `useMemo` for a unified view. This should streamline data management and availability, including locations from existing contacts in addition to master locations.\n\n\n**Refining Master Data Logic**\n\nI\'m currently refining the logic for managing master data, focusing on `masterStandorte` and `masterAbteilungen`. The `allAbteilungen` data is derived by merging master departments with those from contact data, ensuring unique entries. I\'ve built handlers to add, update, and delete standorte, including updates across contacts. Duplicate entries are handled using a set for the abteilungen.\n\n\n"
